    icon f1 size 190 set twemoji x 170 y 520 icon_look picture of "flag united states" hidden true
    icon f2 size 190 set twemoji x 390 y 520 icon_look picture of "flag china" hidden true
    icon f3 size 190 set twemoji x 610 y 520 icon_look picture of "flag russia" hidden true
    icon f4 size 190 set twemoji x 830 y 520 icon_look picture of "flag united kingdom" hidden true
    text q "#1 since 1750?" #b5482e x 500 y 360 font_size 90 hidden true
    thumb band "Who emitted the most CO2?" kind band hidden true

